<description>&lt;p&gt;Motorcycle-borne terrorists opened fire on a CRPF checkpoint in Kulgam, injuring three jawans, one critically, and prompting tightened security across Jammu and Kashmir. The attack has been linked to broader militant activity, while authorities are deploying drones against terror and discussing reforms to vocational education in the region. A fact-check found a viral claim linking a Qaimoh resident’s motorcycle to the Kulgam attack to be false, and a retired lieutenant general noted that internal instability in Pakistan is influencing the situation. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPR2lxZkoyb0cxanhEcF9NSmQ1NnFIWVF0VVBCb095aXJpUTRTRTZHNUFuVGhRU2duWTVseDFiSTVHeF9iZHg5SGkxVGw2Wkl5eHdXcEhtTmhfNmRZcTdSOWYtR0xYMWtwcjljdHdPNEpoaEdsVlNkZHFTVmJldWQ5VU9UVHhPN2tzWmR0WUMyQW54eEVhNlc4aG9iY0Iyd01QZDFyTkQwUzRzbGV5Y2IxanN4VzFKLTJCb0g4R0M5U3FJSkVH?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pragativadi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOQUFqV1NKN01oa0liZzNueHVpcU1XdkUtUEZVbG5tanNOTUtRUFhOTDZTVXBQRmg5YzJsei1Pd2UwTFhnclFLOWZYMUxWSVNzcG5ObzJOaF9XSVk5NVhYUldadDNZTFdNR1RLaVFZSTdKREc2TTJKNDR5aGFpTGdyNTlOSjYtQjFDN2tYU21nY2Z2UWF5V3g3LVJJUllmNnlr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir News Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQTVZ3c09GRUNFdElJM1RvQVNKOG9oWEw1TUs3SUJydC1XLUZTejB0Yk42MkF1SDgzZmJKMWZjdEVJNk40X2tJZWZIYTB6dWpGZkxuLWt3bDZxQjZFc19WNC1ycVRxbHZySk43LVF3MW1lS0xyelBpNUFUenRreHVpa0E0VlBqRlRwbkhaS29NaVhLUmlmb2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5zMFMtemxHV3JDM0MtQmFuWVh4YmktNXNFbG1XemVYUTJuQk43THJwSkpURWNwd2hpbE56N2tER05HZGkzUjJEM